# OASIS – copy to stack.env. No required variables for the default image; TZ/locale come from shared.env.

# TZ/locale: use shared.env (see documents/SHARED-RESOURCES.md)

# Optional: replace the named volume oasis-storage with a host path so files live on your disk.
# In docker-compose.yml, change the oasis-storage volume line to a bind mount, e.g.:
#   - /srv/oasis/storage:/home/storage
